The shape of one entry, for every vocab skill. Fill the {slots} and keep everything else as it is: the three-space indent under the number, the fence at column 0, and the blank line before and after the fence. A slot named like an api_notes column (summary, example, gotcha, doc_url, signature) holds that column's value, so the note saved and the note shown are the same text.

Diff appears only in /vocab:review, since it needs a diff; every other line is filled by every skill. Gotcha is left out when there is nothing worth saying. Labels never change; {group} and the sentences in Params, Returns and Diff follow the output language, while {summary}, {example} and {gotcha} are plain English in every language because they are the saved note. {group} is built-in · standard library · runtime · framework · library in the output language: ko 내장 · 표준 라이브러리 · 런타임 · 프레임워크 · 라이브러리, ja 組み込み · 標準ライブラリ · ランタイム · フレームワーク · ライブラリ. Leave `, {version}` out when there is no version to name.

{n}. {api} — {group} {package}, {version}
   - Signature: `{signature}`
   - Params:
     1. `{param}`: {what it is, and its default or common value}
   - Returns: {returns}
   - Does: {summary}

```{lang}
{example}
```

   - Docs: {doc_url}
   - Gotcha: {gotcha}
   - Diff: {file}:{line}, {half sentence}
